    "urlText": "L1 Dulwich Hill lift out of service.",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-48731",
    "content": "<div>The lift at Dulwich Hill light rail stop on the L1 Dulwich Hill Line is temporarily out of service until further notice.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>For your safety, do not use even if doors open.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Alternative access:</div>\n<div>Use the stairs, if able to<br />Or use the opposite accessible entry/exit pathway via Jack Shanahan Park.<br />&nbsp;</div>\n<div>For urgent assistance:</div>\n<div>Use the Help Point if on the platform<br />Or call 131 500</div>",
    "subtitle": "L1 Dulwich Hill lift out of service.",
    "properties": {
      "smsText": "L1 Dulwich Hill lift out of service.",
      "speechText": "The lift at Dulwich Hill light rail stop on the L1 Dulwich Hill Line is temporarily out of service until further notice.",
